{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02862","headline":"赋得魏都 · 李百药","name":"赋得魏都","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"炎运精华歇，清都宝命开。\n帝里三方盛，王庭万国来。\n玄武疏遥磴，金凤上层台。\n乍进仙童药，时倾避暑杯。\n南馆招奇士，西园引上才。\n还惜刘公干，疲病清漳隈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李百药","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02862.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02862","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}